efinitiv. Net income (GAAP) was <strong>$2.70 billion</strong>, an increase of 20% from last year.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8459785003c3982f\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"July 20, 2023\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.cnbc.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f7f43dcc38549dab\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTesla Releases Second Quarter 2023 Financial Results | Tesla Investor Relations\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f7f43dcc38549dab\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://ir.tesla.com/press-release/tesla-releases-second-quarter-2023-financial-results\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"e79f96f7e036536b\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAUSTIN, Texas, July 19, 2023 – Tesla has released its financial results for the second quarter of 2023 by posting an update on its Investor Relations website. Please visit <strong>https://ir.tesla.com</strong> to view the update.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"e79f96f7e036536b\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"July 19, 2023\",\n      \"siteName\": \"ir.tesla.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8a77bb8b47d79ea5\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTesla Q2 Earnings Report Reveals 45% Profit Drop Amid Weak E.V. Sales - The New York Times\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8a77bb8b47d79ea5\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.nytimes.com/2024/07/23/business/tesla-q2-earnings-elon-musk.html\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6bc3a71c199b5c7f\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe automaker said it earned $1.5 billion in the second quarter of the year on revenue of $25.5 billion. In the second quarter of 2023, Tesla made $2.7 billion and had revenue of <strong>$24.9 billion</strong>.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6bc3a71c199b5c7f\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"July 24, 2024\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.nytimes.com\