arter of 2023, Tesla made $2.7 billion and had revenue of <strong>$24.9 billion</strong>.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"6bc3a71c199b5c7f\">>>", "published": "July 24, 2024", "siteName": "www.nytimes.com"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"34acad32044e913f\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nTesla Q2 2023 results | Automotive World\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"34acad32044e913f\">>>", "url": "https://www.automotiveworld.com/articles/tesla-q2-2023-results/", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"50e0c8b7a696aec9\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nThe effects of Tesla’s (several) price cuts during 2023 are plain to see in its Q2 results: deliveries rose by 83% to 466,000 units, revenue grew at just over half that rate, up 47% to <strong>US$24.9bn</strong> but operating profit dropped by 2.6% and the ...\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"50e0c8b7a696aec9\">>>", "published": "July 21, 2023", "siteName": "www.automotiveworld.com"}]}, "isError": false, "timestamp": 1775284314111}}
